            ("What mechanical keyboard switch characteristic describes a mechanical switch that presses down completely smoothly with zero bump or click noise?", "Linear Mechanical Switch (e.g., Cherry MX Red)", ["Tactile Switch", "Clicky Switch", "Optical Switch"], "Linear switches provide smooth, uninterrupted keystroke travel, preferred by competitive gamers for rapid double-tapping."),
