            ("What keyboard capability allows every single key pressed simultaneously to be registered accurately by the computer without ghosting?", "N-Key Rollover (NKRO)", ["6-Key Rollover (6KRO)", "Anti-Ghosting Matrix", "Key Debouncing"], "True NKRO utilizes individual isolation diodes on every switch, ensuring that pressing dozens of keys at once produces zero missed strokes."),
